## Publishing with `dotnet publish -r <rid>`

This package ships its native binary under the standard, portable `linux-arm`
RID, so `dotnet publish -r linux-arm` works without any extra configuration
-- unlike the Ubuntu runtime packages, which require `UseRidGraph` and an
exact `RuntimeIdentifier` match because they use an Ubuntu-specific RID.

